00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:17.000
to 52.8%,

00:05:14.919 --> 00:05:20.000
the lowest level since records were

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:22.400
gained in 1947. Now, that decline

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:24.640
started long before AI came along, so

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:26.600
I'm not pretending AI caused it. But, if

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:28.760
businesses can produce more with fewer

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:30.919
people, you can see why this matters.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:32.960
